{"4771120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Way Back Beyond", "steam_appid": 4771120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4947840], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another place beyond this world, people call it the 'Beyond'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything there is in a constant state of change and reorganization—monsters born in silence, bizarre plants, treasure chests appearing out of nowhere, and merchants from another world who only appear on the other side. All of this lures in adventurers seeking overnight fame. The adventurer's guild &quot;Anchor&quot; is responsible for opening the portal to send them to the other side, but the instability of time and space means the return path only opens at fixed intervals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the present world with all your loot and strike it rich overnight? Or be forcibly sent back when you can no longer fight? This choice is the cruelest test the other side imposes on every adventurer. Time and again, set forth on the journey home—conquer the other side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolving through the battle against the monster horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with the Ghost Merchant to obtain various weapons and items, and battle hordes of monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/f8671a462ef303e05aa99fb809620e33.poster.avif?t=1787051745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/f8671a462ef303e05aa99fb809620e33.webm?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/f8671a462ef303e05aa99fb809620e33.mp4?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random maps, each game is different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps, learn to utilize the environment and traps, explore and discover to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/cbb4d15020e2f7ee61ea43746a31f042.poster.avif?t=1787051745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/cbb4d15020e2f7ee61ea43746a31f042.webm?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/cbb4d15020e2f7ee61ea43746a31f042.mp4?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evacuate promptly, advance steadily.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing when to stop is a required course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/30bb1fc99d541ad364a27acb9add166b.poster.avif?t=1787051745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/30bb1fc99d541ad364a27acb9add166b.webm?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/30bb1fc99d541ad364a27acb9add166b.mp4?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot supplies and treasure chests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various materials and valuable items and bring them back to the base to make yourself stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/0785f61abe62340748ab9a3009b74809.poster.avif?t=1787051745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/0785f61abe62340748ab9a3009b74809.webm?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/0785f61abe62340748ab9a3009b74809.mp4?t=1787051745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another place beyond this world, people call it the 'Beyond'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything there is in a constant state of change and reorganization—monsters born in silence, bizarre plants, treasure chests appearing out of nowhere, and merchants from another world who only appear on the other side. All of this lures in adventurers seeking overnight fame. The adventurer's guild &quot;Anchor&quot; is responsible for opening the portal to send them to the other side, but the instability of time and space means the return path only opens at fixed intervals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the present world with all your loot and strike it rich overnight? Or be forcibly sent back when you can no longer fight? This choice is the cruelest test the other side imposes on every adventurer. Time and again, set forth on the journey home—conquer the other side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolving through the battle against the monster horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with the Ghost Merchant to obtain various weapons and items, and battle hordes of monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771120/extras/f8671a462ef303e05aa99fb809620e33.poster.avif?t=1787051745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/